companion-v0.2.2

# ClipAI GPU Companion — release trigger.
#
# The first non-empty line above is the release tag. Pushing a change to
# this file on any branch fires .github/workflows/companion-release.yml,
# which builds the Windows .exe/.msi + macOS .dmg, publishes them to a
# GitHub Release, and attaches a sha256 manifest.json. This is the path
# for environments that can push commits but not tags.
#
# To cut a new release: bump the tag on line 1 (e.g. companion-v0.1.1)
# and commit. A tag that already has all three installers is skipped.
